<h2>9 - 14 March 2026, in person @ IIT Mandi (India)</h2>
<p>.</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;">The LARAM international training course in Mandi (India) is an initiative jointly conceived by the University of Salerno (UNISA), NTNU (Norway), IIT Mandi (India), IIT Roorkee (India), IIT Indore (India). The aim the initiative is to develop and conduct a training course dealing with landslide risk management, to be delivered by renowned landslide experts of international reputation.<br /> .</p>
<p><strong>DATES</strong></p>
<ul>
<li>March      9 - 14, 2026</li>
<li>from 8:00 a.m. to 6 p.m. Indian      Time</li>
<li>IN      PERSON</li>
<li>The list of selected students will be issued by 22 December 2025</li>
</ul>
